  "description": "Modbus TCP/UDP protocol library. Implements Modbus Application Protocol V1.1b3 with full 19 function codes (12 public + 7 advanced). Supports ModbusTCP, ModbusUDP, ModbusRtuOverTCP, ModbusRtuOverUDP transport variants. Built on NewLife.IoT standard interfaces with APM tracing support.",
